    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="chapter-related-grid">
      <a class="compare-button" href="/setouchi-cultural-economic-atlas/chapters/strategic-renaturing-screening-map/">v0.1 スクリーニング設計 →</a>
